{"label":"Public USITC original PDF cells; synthetic source identities are supplied by tests, not government approval.","year":2004,"pages":[{"page":5,"cells":[{"text":"Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (2004) -- Supplement 1","x":124.5,"y":755.25},{"text":"Annotated for Statistical Reporting Purposes","x":240.75,"y":746.25},{"text":"XVIII","x":558.75,"y":708.75},{"text":"91-5","x":558,"y":699.75},{"text":"Statistical Notes","x":48.75,"y":681.75},{"text":"1.","x":48.75,"y":663.75},{"text":"The calculation of duties on various watches, clocks, watch movements and clock movements requires that these articles be","x":64.5,"y":664.5},{"text":"constructively separated into their component parts and each component separately valued. The individual components shall be","x":64.5,"y":654.75},{"text":"separately reported under the statistical suffixes show below. In each instance the sum of the values of the individual components shall","x":64.5,"y":645.75},{"text":"be equal to the total value of the article. In those instances where the components of an article are to be separately reported under the","x":64.5,"y":636.75},{"text":"following reporting scheme, the entry should include all the individually named components even if not included in the shipment. In such","x":64.5,"y":627.75},{"text":"instance the entered quantity and value would be zero. For example, entry of a battery powered watch, imported without a battery,","x":64.5,"y":618.75},{"text":"classifiable under subheading 9101.11.40 would include a line for the statistical reporting number for the battery (9101.11.4040) with the","x":64.5,"y":609.75},{"text":"quantity and value shown as zero. To determine the proper statistical reporting number(s) for the subheadings enumerated below, the","x":64.5,"y":600.75},{"text":"importer shall combine the applicable 8-digit subheading number with the applicable statistical suffix found below.","x":64.5,"y":591.75},{"text":"(a)","x":64.5,"y":574.5},{"text":"The